                <mxCell id="subtitle" value="What `docker compose run --rm api python -m allotrope.cli seed-admin` actually does, end-to-end. Idempotent — re-running short-circuits when an admin already exists." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
